A diecast component has a mass of 1.2 kg and density 7150 kg/m³ with surface area of 0.075 m². The thermal conductivity of the material is 95 W/mK and the specific heat is 385 J/kg K. It comes out of the machine at 345°C and is exposed to air at 20°C with a convective heat transfer coefficient of 56.8 W/m²K. Determine:  
