ΔP_g = ρgh
where ρ is the density of water (1000 kg/m³), g is the acceleration due to gravity (9.81 m/s²), and h is the elevation change (20 m).
ΔP_g = 1000 kg/m³ × 9.81 m/s² × 20 m = 196,200 Pa

