   - Reynolds number: \( Re_x = \frac{10 \times 1}{\nu} \).
   - Nusselt number: \( Nu_x = 0.332 Re_x^{0.5} Pr^{0.33} \).
   - Equate \( h \): \( 9 = \frac{0.332 \times \left( \frac{10}{\nu} \right)^{0.5} \times 0.7^{0.33} \times 0.027}{1} \).
